## Custom (no-code) bot template — English.
cb-default-home = 👋 Welcome! This bot is being set up — check back soon.
cb-owner-tip = 🧩 <b>Owner tip:</b> send /build to add pages, buttons, links and commands. Changes are live instantly.
cb-page-gone = This page no longer exists.
cb-builder =
    🧩 <b>Builder</b> — page “{ $title }”
    Command: { $command } · Buttons: { $buttons } · Pages in bot: { $pages }
cb-has-media = 🖼 Media: { $kind }
cb-link =
    🔗 <b>Link button</b> “{ $title }”
    { $url }
cb-btn-add-page = ➕ Page button
cb-btn-add-link = 🔗 Link button
cb-btn-content = ✏️ Content
cb-btn-command = ⌨️ Command
cb-btn-rename = 🏷 Rename
cb-btn-delete = 🗑 Delete
cb-btn-delete-ok = 🗑 Yes, delete it and its sub-pages
cb-btn-up = ⬆️ Parent page
cb-btn-preview = 👁 Preview
cb-btn-export = 📤 Export
cb-btn-import = 📥 Import
cb-btn-no-command = 🚫 No command
cb-ask-title-add = ➕ Send the <b>button label</b> of the new page (e.g. “📍 Location”).
cb-ask-title-link = 🔗 Send the <b>button label</b> of the link (e.g. “🌐 Website”).
cb-ask-title-rename = 🏷 Send the new button label.
cb-ask-url = 🔗 Now send the URL (https://…).
cb-ask-content = ✏️ Send the page content: text (formatting is kept), or a photo/video/file with a caption.
cb-ask-command = ⌨️ Send a command that opens this page, e.g. <code>/prices</code>.
cb-ask-import = 📥 Send the exported <code>.json</code> file. It replaces all current pages.
cb-page-added = ✅ Page “{ $title }” added. Now set its content:
cb-content-saved = ✅ Content saved.
cb-confirm-delete = 🗑 Delete “{ $title }” and everything under it?
cb-exported = 📤 Your bot's pages. Keep it as a backup or import it into another bot (media must be re-uploaded there).
cb-imported = 📥 Imported { $count } pages.
cb-err-title = ⚠️ The label can't be empty.
cb-err-url = ⚠️ That doesn't look like a link. It must start with https:// or tg://
cb-err-limit = ⚠️ Limit reached (24 buttons per page, 150 pages per bot).
cb-err-command = ⚠️ Commands use a–z, 0–9 and _ (max 32), and can't be a built-in like /start.
cb-err-command_taken = ⚠️ Another page already uses that command.
cb-err-import = ⚠️ That file isn't a valid export.
